    "detailed_description": "Ninpaw is a fast-paced action game in which 2 to 4 cats go up against each other in different game modes!<br><br>The game can only be played locally with a controller. However, it is possible to play up to 4 cats online with a single game, thanks to Steam Remote Play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc31 Ninja cats</strong></h2>Take on the role of a ninja cat and engage in frenetic battles! Master the attack, the dash, the bomb and the star to achieve victory. Only the most agile and strategic cat will emerge victorious.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Multiple game modes</strong></h2>Play through a variety of game modes in different rounds. Take on your opponents in a merciless fight to the death, hold on to the crown for as long as possible, pass a bomb to victory or compete to collect coins faster than your opponents!<br><br>The game features a multitude of levels that can be played in most modes.<br>Don't forget to try and unlock the Steam achievements!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Fun for everyone</strong></h2>Whether you're a skilled player or a fighting game novice, Ninpaw offers a gameplay experience accessible to all. Easy to learn, yet difficult to master, this game guarantees hours of entertainment for players of all levels. Fun for all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae How to play NINPAW</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Throw out your opponents with your 4 attacks<br></li><li>Be reactive to avoid falling into the void<br></li><li>Focus on the objectives</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Play local multiplayer</strong></h2>You can also use Steam Remote Play Together to play with your friends online, free of charge.",
    "about_the_game": "Ninpaw is a fast-paced action game in which 2 to 4 cats go up against each other in different game modes!<br><br>The game can only be played locally with a controller. However, it is possible to play up to 4 cats online with a single game, thanks to Steam Remote Play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc31 Ninja cats</strong></h2>Take on the role of a ninja cat and engage in frenetic battles! Master the attack, the dash, the bomb and the star to achieve victory. Only the most agile and strategic cat will emerge victorious.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Multiple game modes</strong></h2>Play through a variety of game modes in different rounds. Take on your opponents in a merciless fight to the death, hold on to the crown for as long as possible, pass a bomb to victory or compete to collect coins faster than your opponents!<br><br>The game features a multitude of levels that can be played in most modes.<br>Don't forget to try and unlock the Steam achievements!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Fun for everyone</strong></h2>Whether you're a skilled player or a fighting game novice, Ninpaw offers a gameplay experience accessible to all. Easy to learn, yet difficult to master, this game guarantees hours of entertainment for players of all levels. Fun for all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae How to play NINPAW</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Throw out your opponents with your 4 attacks<br></li><li>Be reactive to avoid falling into the void<br></li><li>Focus on the objectives</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Play local multiplayer</strong></h2>You can also use Steam Remote Play Together to play with your friends online, free of charge.",
